{
  "_doc": [
    "THE LOCATOR REGISTRY — specs name keys, never selectors.",
    "",
    "Two kinds of entry, and the distinction is the non-masking guarantee:",
    "  kind:'role'  ACTION targets. Healable. Resolved via getByRole, so a heal is a",
    "               change to `primary` here and nothing else.",
    "  kind:'css'   ASSERTION targets (totals, amounts). NOT healable, by construction.",
    "               An assertion target must never be rewritten to make a test pass —",
    "               that is how a self-healing suite hides a real bug.",
    "",
    "`fingerprint` is written on the last GREEN run. Self-healing has a cold-start:",
    "with no recorded fingerprint there is nothing to score against, so the baseline",
    "run is mandatory before any mutation."
  ],
